WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:08.508
ROOM FIVE, TAEKO OKAJIMA, 25 POINTS

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.394
Before the test...

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:25.358
we had art class.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:30.363
And... um... we did blow pictures.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:32.073
Blow pictures?

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:36.911
Yes. We drop paint on the paper...

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:41.291
and blow patterns in it.

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:43.793
And?

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:49.132
You blow like this, really hard, right?

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:50.967
Yes?

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:57.057
So, I got a headache.
From blowing so hard.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.601
That's why you did so badly?

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:02.395
That's right.

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:05.106
I see.

00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:13.615
Do you know the answers now?

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.992
The correct answers?

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.748
Have Yaeko help you with them.

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:23.583
Yaeko?

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:25.001
That's right.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.796
Or Nanako, whichever.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.842
I'll ask Nanako.

